proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Discussed Multi Cycle By-pass Valve (MCBV) operational problems with service companies and town.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T12:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted several times to cycle MCBV. Pulled out of hole from 207 m to surface. Broke out and laid out MCBV.
Simultaneously had discussion and meeting with town regarding modified procedure and BHA configuration. Decided to take out MCBV and orient Whipstock with gyro on wireline.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T12:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Tool box talk with crew prior to making up Whipstock assembly</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T18:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">266</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Picked up and made up 13-3/8&quot; TrackMaster Whipstock assembly with 12-1/4&quot; Mill BHA. Surface to 266 m.Verified UBHO toolface offset and whipstock scribe lines.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T18:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Ran in hole with Whipstock assembly from 266 m to final setting depth 432 m. Took 2 ton weight at 274 m but dropping off.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held tool box talk with crew prior to rigging up wireline.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T20:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Rigged up wireline sheaves and picked up Gyro tool. Ran in hole with Gyro to 402 m (UBHO sub).
Found tool face orientation to be 178 deg. Rotated string to 190 deg. Confirmed by Gyro.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T20:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pulled out with wireline and confirmed tell tale ok on Gyro. Moved string up/down twice to work out torque. Up/down weight 108/104 ton.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Ran in hole with gyro on wireline to 402m. Found tool face to be 187 deg. (target =190 deg +/- 5 deg). Pulled out wireline and gyro.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-29T23:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">432</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>On final position screwed in with TDS. Pressured up the string to 253  bar/10 min to set the Whipstock slips. Observe hook load decrease from 106 t to 99 t. Proper setting confirm by setting down 10 t and applying over pull 10 ton. Pulled 140 ton  (32 ton overpull) to shear bolt for 12-1/4&quot; FastTrack mill. Confirmed mill to be free.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-06-29T23:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-06-30T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">416</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Laid out 2 ea 3 m pup joints and made up one stand to string
Midnight depth 416 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
